near"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":90.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"61598f2f-9d3e-529d-acb4-a8a170927b25","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# spell_heal_motes\n\nSupport-mage heal: a ring of small green-gold motes (radius 14 u) rising around a unit.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -15..15, y 1..17, z -15..15 units (0.84 x 0.45 x 0.84 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 24.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 30 x 16 x 30 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 1.6 | loop | two mote rings rise 30 u and turn, half a cycle apart (fade at the top is the game's) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_mote0_0, glow_mote0_0_t, glow_mote0_1, glow_mote0_1_t, glow_mote0_2, glow_mote0_2_t, glow_mote0_3, glow_mote0_3_t, glow_mote0_4, glow_mote0_4_t, glow_mote0_5, glow_mote0_5_t ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"}